<title>HONG KONG: Hong Kong stock exchange to announce new chief.</title>
<headline>Hong Kong stock exchange to announce new chief.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Stock Exchange of Hong Kong said it would announce the appointment of a new chief executive later on Wednesday following a meeting of its Council.</p>
<p>The exchange said it would hold a news conference at 5:15 p.m. (0915 GMT).</p>
<p>Paul Chow, who has served as chief executive since 1991, said in July he would retire on January 31, 1997.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6345</p>
